{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_1_level_main_01-01_beg","groupId":"main_1","stageId":"main_01-01","title":"孤岛","storyCode":"1-1","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_01-01_beg.txt","sourceHash":"0740a344122409c36a735279f10d462e1723ac7cc1693f7e97e4843d003c7ec8","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"天灾的压力不断啃噬着博士一行的精神力，而临光闹出的小小插曲稍微打消了一点紧张的气氛。\n回家的路途还在继续。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第七关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫干员","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"是我的错觉，还是天确实越来越暗了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"......我也希望是你的错觉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"不过我们本来时间就不多。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_9_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"天灾云的形状比刚才黑压压的一片更加清晰了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啧，裸眼看着它慢慢在头上凝聚显形，可不是什么好兆头。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"加上，下城区的每一条街道都可能埋伏着整合运动......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"不，这个说法太过保守了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"该说是，整合运动满满当当地挤在街上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"几乎每条街上都有暴徒在搞破坏，抢劫，焚毁交通工具和店铺......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"这帮家伙，是觉得天气太好，所以出来野餐集会吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"现在跑出来野餐，一定会遭到天灾的无情摧残。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"这说明大部分整合运动都是些被野蛮冲昏头脑的傻瓜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......噗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"他们不是真的要......野餐啦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"我，我只是发个牢骚，不是那个意思......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是个形容吗？难道说这是个包袱？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"临光","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，总是在这种时候......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"唔唔唔......没，没事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"反而是憋笑有点难受......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，抱歉......明明是很紧要的时期，我却......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我们不是为了让大家都哭丧着脸才建立起罗德岛的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛，本来就希望各位，都能绽放笑容。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"阿，阿米娅......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系的，医生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"那我们，就去为侦查工作贡献一份力量吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"四点钟方向的敌人，我会安静地处理掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"只要他们体内的病变器官不是什么警报器或爆炸物就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"另一侧，游离于据点之外的大批整合运动，就交给我们吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"只要杂音够大，就没有人能分辨出里面究竟包含了什么声音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，各自行动起来！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米娅"]},{"speakerId":"char_013_riop","aliases":["近卫干员"]},{"speakerId":"char_014_riope","aliases":["Ace"]},{"speakerId":"char_016_medic","aliases":["医疗干员"]},{"speakerId":"char_130_doberm","aliases":["杜宾"]},{"speakerId":"char_148_nearl","aliases":["临光"]}]}
